  "description": "Ogg Vorbis encoding for CodeBrix.Audio. OggVorbisEncoder turns float samples into a standard .ogg stream - quality-based variable bitrate or managed bitrate, any channel count and sample rate, Vorbis comments - over self-built native libraries shipped in the package for Windows x64 and ARM64, macOS Intel and Apple Silicon, Linux x64, ARM64 and RISC-V 64, and Android 13+ ARM64 and x64. One Register() call lets CodeBrix.Audio write .ogg files by file name.",
